abstract: >-
  Awareness is a local-first public-text ingestion engine. It backfills
  any historical date range from Common Crawl and HuggingFace FineWeb,
  and live-tails RSS / sitemaps / GDELT for fresh items, writing
  everything to Apache Iceberg on local disk for query via DuckDB or any
  Iceberg-aware engine. Single Python process, no cluster required.
